rem Disc Game Prize Fund
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=121
rem Find the greatest whole prize that
rem a fair game can offer when winning
rem takes a blue majority in N turns

use bits
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Turns integer = 15

rem Turn t draws blue with chance
rem 1/(t+1). Over all 2^N blue/red
rem outcomes a blue weighs 1 and a red
rem weighs t; the total is (N+1)!.
Size = 1 Turns shl
Turn = 1 to Turns array
M = (0 till Size array) reshape Size 1
Blue = M (Turn - 1) bit
Wt' = Blue choose 1 Turn
Ways' = Wt reduce * rank 1
Cnt' = Blue count axis 1
Win' = Cnt * 2 greater Turns
All' = 2 to (Turns + 1) array
Total' = All reduce *
Wins' = Ways filter Win array
Sum' = Wins sum
Answer = Total // Sum
Answer print
